{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_d69eecaf411beabe2d39a22d95b311a881bf4becdce7441dc31adf12abfdd089", "title": "Nebula (band)", "text": "Nebula are an American rock band, formed by guitarist Eddie Glass and drummer Ruben Romano upon departing Fu Manchu in 1997. Mark Abshire soon joined as the band's original bassist. Nebula have been on indefinite hiatus since early 2010 but have not broken up.", "score": 24.3146}, {"id": "hp_doc_67103414f742668764929bd4e802718eee3b330d8281770dbb83bec62a3d83fa", "title": "In Search Of... (Fu Manchu album)", "text": "In Search Of... is the third studio album by Fu Manchu, a stoner rock band from Southern California. It was released in 1996 on Mammoth Records. This was the last album with Ruben Romano and Eddie Glass. Shortly after its release, they left to form the band Nebula.", "score": 23.2769}, {"id": "hp_doc_9a9381647047aaa7b4d3b857be80943ce157db93e821790b0b9924a71bc14fd9", "title": "Eddie Glass", "text": "Eddie Glass (born December 19, 1970) is an American rock musician best known for his work with punk band Olivelawn, and stoner rock bands Nebula, and Fu Manchu. Nebula has been Glass' primary musical group since 1997, when he and drummer Ruben Romano acrimoniously split from Fu Manchu.", "score": 22.6845}], "remaining_searches": 2}
